{"id":"83107a17d9417d6d","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order.md","title":"ZFC LC Large Cardinal Strength Order","display":"df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order — ZFC LC Large Cardinal Strength Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order"],"display":"df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order — ZFC LC Large Cardinal Strength Order","depends_on":["[[58-df-consistency-strength]]","[[58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order — ZFC LC Large Cardinal Strength Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"121ea2e24c75ec11\" href=\"?note=121ea2e24c75ec11\" title=\"58-df-consistency-strength\">58-df-consistency-strength</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b00c32fa4e76ff85\" href=\"?note=b00c32fa4e76ff85\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set\">58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\in V\">\\(p,q,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\in}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\in}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> are the canonical membership signature and ZFC theory from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b00c32fa4e76ff85\" href=\"?note=b00c32fa4e76ff85\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set\">58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConsistencyStrengthLeq}_{\\mathrm{meta}}:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ConsistencyStrengthLeq}_{\\mathrm{meta}}:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the relative-consistency relation with explicit proof system, signature, and contradiction formula (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"121ea2e24c75ec11\" href=\"?note=121ea2e24c75ec11\" title=\"58-df-consistency-strength\">58-df-consistency-strength</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcLargeCardinalStrengthOrder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcLargeCardinalStrengthOrder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}strength\\text{-}order}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcLargeCardinalStrengthOrder}_S(p,q,\\mathcal P,\\bot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in},S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}})\n\\land p,q,\\bot\\in S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\n\\land\\operatorname{ConsistencyStrengthLeq}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{p\\},\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{q\\},\\mathcal P,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\bot)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}strength\\text{-}order}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcLargeCardinalStrengthOrder}_S(p,q,\\mathcal P,\\bot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in},S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}})\n\\land p,q,\\bot\\in S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\n\\land\\operatorname{ConsistencyStrengthLeq}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{p\\},\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{q\\},\\mathcal P,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\bot)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relation compares the relative consistency strength of ZFC augmented by two closed sentences. In large-cardinal applications <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> express the relevant hypotheses; no undeclared classifier of “large-cardinal sentences” is needed.</li>\n<li>The proof system and contradiction formula are truth-relevant arguments.  They are no longer silently hidden behind a binary infix relation that the dependency never defined.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-consistency-strength","status":"resolved","id":"121ea2e24c75ec11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-consistency-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set","status":"resolved","id":"b00c32fa4e76ff85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_{\\in}$ and $\\mathrm{ZFC}$ are the canonical membership signature and ZFC theory from [[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set","status":"resolved","id":"b00c32fa4e76ff85","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-consistency-strength","status":"resolved","id":"121ea2e24c75ec11","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ConsistencyStrengthLeq}_{\\mathrm{meta}}:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the relative-consistency relation with explicit proof system, signature, and contradiction formula (see [[58-df-consistency-strength]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,q,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConsistencyStrengthLeq}_{\\mathrm{meta}}:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcLargeCardinalStrengthOrder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}large\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}strength\\text{-}order}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcLargeCardinalStrengthOrder}_S(p,q,\\mathcal P,\\bot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in},S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}})\n\\land p,q,\\bot\\in S_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\n\\land\\operatorname{ConsistencyStrengthLeq}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{p\\},\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{q\\},\\mathcal P,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\bot)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false}],"bytes":1907,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2450","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order.md|58-df-zfc-lc-large-cardinal-strength-order]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["121ea2e24c75ec11","b00c32fa4e76ff85","a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}